sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Client A (ceph.ko)
  participant M as MDS
  participant B as Client B
  A->>M: open(f, O_RDWR) → caps request Fwb
  M-->>A: grant pAsLsXsFrwcb (sole writer)
  A->>A: write → page cache (Fb: buffer)
  B->>M: open(f, O_RDONLY)
  M->>A: revoke Fcb (cap op REVOKE)
  A->>A: writeback of dirty pages to the OSDs
  A->>M: cap ack / FLUSH (size, mtime)
  M-->>B: grant Fr (no c: no cache)
  B->>B: read directly from the OSD (sync read)
